Any .svg files placed here, with names that match items in the main twe-svg.zip archive,
will be used in place of the originals from there.

1f979 and 1f97a are overridden due to bugs in the SVGs:
  https://github.com/jdecked/twemoji/commit/dbb2a105307932399402c5333001e82ba67af016#commitcomment-124376242

1f3a7 is because we want our headphone emoji without the music notes (so they can represent being on a call too)
  This image is contributed from Sable by @j0lol from on https://github.com/element-hq/element-web/pull/35890 where
  it is released under the terms of the Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International license.
